# Keep every text file on LF line endings, in the repository and in the
# working copy, on every OS. Biome and the TanStack Router plugin write LF;
# with Windows' `core.autocrlf=true`, files would otherwise be checked out
# as CRLF and fail `bun run check`.
# Binary files (images, the .xlsx tracker) are detected and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
